# The engine build's context, read in place of the root .dockerignore (docs/images.md, "The engine compiles only on a source change").
# A page or a note is no input of the compile: leaving it out keeps the compiled layer cached across a docs-only push.
**/docs
**/*.md
**/node_modules
**/.git
engine/k7-runtime/build
engine/k7-supervisor/build
**/rust/target
